OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry to start, with bright or
OL,6,Fsunny spells. Cloud thickens, with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain arriving from the
OL,8,Fsouthwest by late morning, this
OL,9,Fbecoming persistent and often heavy
OL,10,Fthrough the afternoon. Temperatures
OL,11,Fslightly above average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FHeavy rain this evening for
OL,14,Fmany places. Overnight the rain eases
OL,15,Fto become light and then slowly dies
OL,16,Faway for most areas, leaving dry and
OL,17,Flargely cloudy conditions.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
